Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking aim for your\Nheart so it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand tall and read, go to\Nhell and jump for paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time dangerous, dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We like it serious, serious, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking deep in the dream,\Nthere is the one in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:00:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls built between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Still what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:00:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, working hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.78,0:01:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.14,0:01:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.42,0:01:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our thought again, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.92,0:01:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the foolish ones\Nwe love. We'll carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we see the light, the sun will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core\Nis against myself forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's do it now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The bombs filled between\Nus. They will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So what we don't know, that's\Nwhat we call adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.19,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy the sensation of\Ncandy slowly seeping into your bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't break free. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.14,0:03:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up yet, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet release will come soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have been on\Nquite the sugar high if
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you thought you could take\Nyour ship back from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Admittingly, you put up\Na good fight at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sorry to say you ran\Nover your heads from the starch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We had soldiers stationed around the\Nisland on lickety lookout for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You really had nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.34,0:03:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our difference in strength is clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.78,0:03:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.36,0:03:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.20,0:03:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Tupper go! I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what happens when\Nyou decide to defy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.62,0:03:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I turn you into a candy\Nman and devour you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The sugarcoating will cover your\Nentire body and permeate your insides.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll lickety-leave you in complete\Nagonies that robs you of your last breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.42,0:04:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole process only\Ntakes about three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I just can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be looking at two\Nsweet candied corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.32,0:04:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.78,0:04:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A little too late to reconsider my offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you several chances to escape,\Nbut you two thought you knew better?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and chose this fate yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have a lick of\Nwisdom, so have sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And a bitter defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Clupper, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Time's a-ticking, so\Nlet the countdown begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.78,0:05:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only getting what\Nyou deserve, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, reconsider this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.18,0:05:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No one likes bones in their candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn you into a candy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And lick you down to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Press.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.86,0:05:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Her hunger pangs won't\Nlickety let up. Cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:06:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We had better start ignoring\NMama to pudding on Cacao Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If she finds out there's no wedding cake\Non this ship, she will lickety kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we're at that stage yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.40,0:06:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get on the Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Link, Straw Hats are still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.06,0:06:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But lightning must have\Ntaken out our own forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sunny has been hijacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Rook! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.80,0:07:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to the mirror world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You've only got a few seconds at most\Nbefore you're all lying at his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Pierre Sparrow and Katakuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it had to be those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we aren't\Nin the clear just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Coo-coo-coo-coo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive that you've\Nbeen able to get this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I underestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But just to make it abundantly\Nclear, Your fun-ins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your final resting place!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy Maiden!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's underselling it a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lickety-look at what it can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.26,0:08:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.17,0:08:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.09,0:08:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A quick fist, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't move! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.56,0:08:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please work!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Underestimating me will bring your end!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy Maiden!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.64,0:08:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Decoration!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too big to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.68,0:08:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for my next trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will leave you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's circle around to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.32,0:08:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather plow straight through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,His Devil Fruit ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like Luffy's!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me my cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Here she comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.02,0:10:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the plan, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, get Katakuri off of the sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll focus on our departure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have come here through the mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:10:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my wedding cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.08,0:11:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I certainly don't envy being on the\Nreceiving end of her hunger pegs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.96,0:11:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good lickety-luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Harm-a-ment. Harnet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kong Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.62,0:11:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kong Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.78,0:11:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.74,0:11:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't my Haki working?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.07,0:11:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Brook, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.58,0:11:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.66,0:11:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Be prepared for a sudden\Nturn of events. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I firmly believe Luffy and\Nhis crew are those whom our
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,tribe and the Kozuki clan\Nhave awaited for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones who will lead all of\Nus to the dawn of a new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.66,0:12:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I see this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there, Mondor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.46,0:12:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We will lead you to arrange a ship\Nblockade around the southwest coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Press.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It said that we are to surround the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Coup de what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.00,0:13:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll use Coup de Burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.02,0:13:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship can leap a\Nwhole kilometer ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't use it, Big Mom\Nis just going to sink us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think it'll be enough to\Nescape her grasp, then I won't argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's bet our getaway on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, I think Mom's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought you could run?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.26,0:13:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Carrot, go help Luffy set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.54,0:13:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it must be here someplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brooke, Chopper,\Nstay strong, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a bitter escape if you\Ntwo didn't make it with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We've located the Straw\NHats at the Southwest Coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister Amand from the\NNuts Island Tartt speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're approaching the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Those battleships are closing\Nin on us from the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.26,0:14:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And Big Mom looms over us on land.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we're trapped in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.92,0:14:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, we have to get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.54,0:14:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have to load up two more\Nbig barrels of cola, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go help prepare the coop,\Ndo whatever it is, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just our luck we can't use\Ncoo to burst like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Something up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We hit a snag.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sunny is trapped in\Nsome kind of sticky candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.70,0:15:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good lickety look\Nat my candy. Wave's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admire its perfection with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the tomb guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You turn my friend in\Nthe ship back right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting dire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.30,0:16:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Will mama lickity kick\Nyour butts to the curb?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.62,0:16:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Will the cannons capsize you before then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you vermin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.84,0:16:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All your hope is lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Beast sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Karajishi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You do realize my bounty is 700 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.26,0:17:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And what are you worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you knew that you were way\Nout of your lickety-league, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You avoided death by\Nthe skin of your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.22,0:17:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't die just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The dawn of the new world is coming soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.00,0:17:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't rest until I've seen it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.64,0:17:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you a char?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:18:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it fifty years, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the rest of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.40,0:18:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I must hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It was clever to sacrifice your left eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.28,0:18:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama has killed other men\Nfor much less, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But why do you want to live so badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Clamming up, huh? Well, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.42,0:18:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So how old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.28,0:18:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm 27.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You've had 50 years of your\Nlickety lifespan drained by Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.86,0:18:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So that now puts you at 77. Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many years you've got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll choose where to die myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.10,0:18:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.01,0:18:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.46,0:18:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You were captain of the\NNox pirates, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Nox mean night?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that sounds rather dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the negativity, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Every night comes to an end, as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nox could mean Before the dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You Karoo understand
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.46,0:19:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The men who I admire Are\Nawaiting the dawn of the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,new world All I want is to\Nlay its foundation For them
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have enough time\Nfor that I can die happy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You once said That before the dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And Nox were synonymous\Nwith one another, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.42,0:19:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's such a shame that the\Nonly Nox you'll come to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,know is the eternal darkness\Nthat awaits in your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Odin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.58,0:19:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:19:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.08,0:19:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not quite ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a kid! I'm Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.36,0:20:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is I don't have much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.45,0:20:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone will have a day when\Nit's their moment to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait and you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you'll know\Nwhen your time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You just got to stick it out until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nice meeting you, Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.40,0:20:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's with that look on your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:20:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, roger told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.82,0:21:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone will get a chance to shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you rambling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.64,0:21:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be more than enough\Nto undo all of your little tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.86,0:21:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's dynamite!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.22,0:21:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lickety lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I had a feeling\Nthat this would be my final voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.24,0:21:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Pedro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Adios.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.82,0:22:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Pedro?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.46,0:22:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, Yugara will\Nunderstand my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.76,0:22:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it was to keep Luffy and his crew\Nalive so they can continue onward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.32,0:22:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Yugaro must keep\Nmoving forward! Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.22,0:22:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Press.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.70,0:22:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.94,0:22:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I hope Mama and\NMinister Perospero are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.38,0:22:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they got blown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.14,0:23:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Their candy is melting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.66,0:23:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Press dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.14,0:23:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Pedro give up his life for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.06,0:23:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this truly the only\Noption that we had left?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.70,0:23:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that was going to\Nbe the end for me for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.82,0:23:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you two all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.00,0:23:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Karen, it's too late. Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.58,0:23:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to help Pedro, don't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.70,0:23:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He might be alive out there. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.34,0:23:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.00,0:23:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro sacrificed himself for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.20,0:23:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved our lives because there\Nwas no other way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.02,0:23:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let his death be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.10,0:24:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.86,0:24:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Try the fly. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.08,0:24:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.12,0:24:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.24,0:24:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys still with us up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.76,0:24:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.67,0:24:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.59,0:24:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're beginning to come around now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.14,0:24:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then, it's time to set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.34,0:24:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro bought us this time with his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No way I'm gonna let that go to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.64,0:24:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here,\Nno matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.50,0:24:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.62,0:24:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.36,0:24:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all so emotional!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.40,0:24:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.96,0:24:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a second of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.58,0:24:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, Carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.22,0:25:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.24,0:25:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Straighten up, get on your feet, Carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.46,0:25:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And take the blade once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.96,0:25:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She has no aptitude for swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.04,0:25:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.00,0:25:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.46,0:25:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot will become a peerless\Nswordsman under my guidance!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.90,0:25:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more than one way to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.06,0:25:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely there's another route\Nthat's better suited for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.62,0:25:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.80,0:25:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a fighting stance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.44,0:25:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling this may be\Na better fit for you, Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.70,0:26:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better to play to your advantages.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.62,0:26:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're quite\Nadept at aerial maneuvers,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.56,0:26:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,so Combine that with your electro and\Nyou, Karoo, will be off to a good start!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.20,0:26:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.32,0:26:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.23,0:26:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.15,0:26:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be your sparring partner. Okie Dock!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.26,0:26:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I was starting to think I'd never\Nbe strong like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.42,0:26:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the\Nanswer was here all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.60,0:26:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for teaching me this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.66,0:26:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how you Karoo battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.98,0:26:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep honing your skills\Nand be ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.26,0:26:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you Karoo can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.28,0:26:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.82,0:26:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.74,0:27:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't leave this\Nisland as long as I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.40,0:27:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of her! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.60,0:27:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot, leave him to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.34,0:27:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're strong\Nenough to kick me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.66,0:27:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.24,0:27:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the captain of this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.36,0:27:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.44,0:28:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Elephant, don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.18,0:28:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sales look good towards the northwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.58,0:28:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido burst azimuth 45\Ndegrees to northwest!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.00,0:28:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, going back will prevent\Nme from hurting your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.68,0:28:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,even if you can see what's coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.04,0:28:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop us from leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.14,0:28:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, brother, I'm here to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.78,0:28:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.88,0:28:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let them escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.88,0:28:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All units, prepare to\Nfire on the enemy ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.34,0:28:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjust elevation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.50,0:28:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.41,0:28:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Shark, it's time to boogie!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.28,0:28:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.40,0:28:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab ahold of the rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.62,0:28:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's pull our submersible\Ncloser to the Sunny
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.64,0:28:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,before they start\Nattacking the poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.62,0:28:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.54,0:28:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can stand up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.64,0:28:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.56,0:28:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.78,0:29:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tia Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.52,0:29:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.86,0:29:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She caught up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.14,0:29:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.76,0:29:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get out of here quick\Nbefore she damages this Sunny anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.78,0:29:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.16,0:29:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Pedro?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.48,0:29:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So he did survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.52,0:29:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He almost had me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.70,0:29:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.36,0:29:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Candy Guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.66,0:29:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He was actually fighting\Nfor a second there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.70,0:29:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That crazy mink licked it\Nleft with my candy armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.74,0:29:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's unfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.24,0:29:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.70,0:29:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And not Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.70,0:30:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears all our cannonballs\Nwere intercepted this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.76,0:30:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Third round.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.68,0:30:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and prepare the cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.50,0:30:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.96,0:30:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot! Inami!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.10,0:30:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.48,0:30:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.39,0:30:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.66,0:30:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.28,0:30:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.86,0:30:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hold down the fort?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.98,0:30:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Murphy, what are you two talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.20,0:30:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,When the lever returns to its original\Nposition, the refill process is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.26,0:30:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.38,0:30:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Better hold on to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.88,0:30:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Death grip commenced.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.30,0:30:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Too ready for takeoff\Nwhen you are, Jinbei.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.70,0:30:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We're good over here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.68,0:31:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.78,0:31:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the target get away. Now fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.34,0:31:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.52,0:31:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lastly, don't forget to shout!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.80,0:31:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.10,0:31:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaku now burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.36,0:31:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.36,0:31:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.86,0:31:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.98,0:31:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Amand reporting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.24,0:31:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy has escaped by air. It's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.46,0:31:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Loopy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.94,0:32:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.72,0:32:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.26,0:32:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well played.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.42,0:32:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can fight you\Nwithout any interruptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.88,0:32:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.98,0:32:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That was his path back!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.44,0:32:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that guy thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.20,0:32:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's your captain's\Ndetermination, Val.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.86,0:32:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.04,0:32:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This place will be your grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.78,0:32:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll go back to the sunny.\NRight after I kick your ass!
